# This repository is PUBLIC. This file is deny-by-default on purpose.
#
# Everything is ignored unless a rule below explicitly allows it. A blocklist
# fails open: the day a new kind of state file appears, it gets committed
# because nobody thought to deny it. An allowlist fails safe.
#
# To track a genuinely new path, add an explicit `!` rule for it.

# ── deny everything ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/*

# ── allow the tooling ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
!/.gitignore
!/CLAUDE.md
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/install.sh
!/bin/
!/lib/
!/tests/
!/scripts/

# ── landmines inside the allowed directories ──────────────────────────────────
# Credentials and account state, in case one is ever copied in for debugging.
**/.credentials.json
**/*.credentials.json
**/.claude.json
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Account backups produced by the delete path, and any archive.
**/*.tgz
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tar
**/*.zip

# Test scratch: fake HOMEs and fake multi roots must never be committed.
/tests/tmp/
/tests/.tmp/
**/tmp/
**/*.tmp

# Captured output and logs can contain absolute home paths and account names.
**/*.log
**/*.out

# Never track a real config tree that wandered into the repo.
**/.claude/
**/.claude-multi/
**/shared/
**/.trash/

# OS and editor noise.
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
**/*~
